DATA — proposed CC BY 4.0, NOT YET IN EFFECT

The derived data under data/ is unpublished dissertation material and is NOT
released under an open licence while the chapter is in preparation. The
intended licence at publication is Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0). Until then it is shared for review and
collaboration only; please do not redistribute.

Upstream data carries its own terms:
  - 717 v5.1 genome and annotation — Phytozome / JGI, subject to the JGI data
    use policy for the relevant release.
  - Public RNA-seq — the 38 BioProjects listed in data/expr/studies.json,
    each with its own citation and DOI.
